w: As I came o-ver yon-der hill I spied a might-y tur-key. He flapped his wings and he spread his tail, And his feet looked aw-ful dirt-y. Fol-link-a-ti-dy, Fol-de-link-a-ti-dy-o, Fol-link-a-ti-dy, And his feet looked aw-ful dirt-y.
